; Bug repro: a valid CBORK Export directive immediately before a rule currently
; emits E020 in strict CLI lint even though it should mark that rule exported.
;
; Expected after fix:
; - strict lint succeeds
; - public-rule is recorded as an exported library rule

;@ CBORK: Library
;@ CBORK: Export
public-rule = private-helper

private-helper = bstr .size 16
